  "abstract": "<jats:p>\n                    An ultra\u2010high bandwidth (BW) and a low\n                    <jats:italic>\n                      V\n                      <jats:sub>\u03c0</jats:sub>\n                    </jats:italic>\n                    InP Mach\u2010Zehnder modulator with an n\u2010i\u2010p\u2010n heterostructure is proposed. The combination of the n\u2010i\u2010p\u2010n heterostructure and the capacitive\u2010loaded travelling\u2010wave electrode provides a modulator with extremely low electrical loss. The device exhibits a 3\u00a0dB electro\u2010optic BW of over 67\u00a0GHz and a\n                    <jats:italic>\n                      V\n                      <jats:sub>\u03c0</jats:sub>\n                    </jats:italic>\n                    of 2.0 V. A 100\u00a0Gb/s non\u2010return\u2010to\u2010zero on\u2013off keying modulation with an extinction ratio of over 10\u00a0dB is also realised.\n                  </jats:p>",
